<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Cygnus inc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cygnus inc started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Patricia Bank said she started Cygnus Inc with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the drug delivery and diagnostic systems company were up 5/8 at 15-1/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;The company's higher than average valuation is directly associated with the potential of its GlucoWatch glucose monitor, which, if all goes well, could potentially be commercialized in early-to-mid 1996,&quot; Bank said.</p>
<p>--The GlucoWatch is a medical device for regularly testing blood sugar levels without using the finger-stab blood sampling method commonly used by most diabetics.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
